  This distribution bundles third-party components, each governed by its
  own license. See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md for the full list of components,
  their versions, licenses, and attribution requirements.

  第三方组件的许可条款优先于本许可。对于第三方组件，
  alicewe1 既不授予任何权利，也不代表其权利人行事。

  Third-party licenses take precedence over this license. alicewe1 grants
  no rights in third-party components and does not act on behalf of their
  rights holders.

【再分发限制 / Redistribution restrictions】
  下列组件**不得**随本作品一并再分发，除非另行取得权利人授权：
  The following components MUST NOT be redistributed with this work unless
