        third-party prompt and skill packs that declare no license

  详见 THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md。
  See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md for details.

【关于软件适用性 / On software applicability】
  Creative Commons 官方明确建议不要将 CC 系列许可用于软件，
  因其不包含专利授权等软件许可通常需要的条款。
  本作品选择 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 是为了表达「禁止商业使用」与
  「衍生作品须沿用同一许可」两项要求；如需更贴合软件的分发条款，
  请以权利人后续发布的版本为准。

  Creative Commons advises against using its licenses for software, as they
  lack terms software licensing normally needs (such as a patent grant).
  CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 was chosen here to express two requirements: no commercial
  use, and share-alike for derivative works.

